{
  "title": "SNS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "한 메시지를 여러 구독자에게 발행하는 pub/sub 서비스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#topics-publishers-and-subscriptions\">Topics, Publishers and Subscriptions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#standard-topics\">Standard Topics</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fifo-topics\">FIFO Topics</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#subscription-filter-policies\">Subscription Filter Policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fan-out-with-sqs\">Fan-out with SQS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#delivery-retries-and-dead-letter-queues\">Delivery Retries and Dead-letter Queues</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#security-and-observability\">Security and Observability</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>50 / 62</span></div><h1>SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span>는 Topic에 발행된 Message를 여러 Subscription으로 전달하는 Publish/Subscribe 서비스다. 하나의 Event를 Billing·Email·Analytics 등 독립 Consumer에 동시에 전달하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fan-out-with-sqs\">Fan-out</a>에 적합하다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Queue 하나를 여러 Worker가 나누어 소비하는 구조와 다르다. 각 시스템이 모든 Event를 받아야 하면 SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span> Topic에 시스템별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Queue를 연결한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"구독자별 독립 처리\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>구독자별 독립 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Billing subscriber</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span> Topic</strong><small>주문 Event 발행</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Billing <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Queue</strong><small>독립 Message Copy</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Billing Worker</strong><small>자기 속도로 처리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Shipping subscriber</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Same SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span> Topic</strong><small>같은 Event</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Shipping <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Queue</strong><small>별도 보존·재시도</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Shipping Worker</strong><small>Billing 장애와 분리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">하나의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Queue를 Worker 여러 개가 나누어 소비하는 구조와 다르다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"topics-publishers-and-subscriptions\"><h2>Topics, Publishers and Subscriptions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#topics-publishers-and-subscriptions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Publisher가 Topic에 Message를 보내면 Subscription의 Endpoint로 전달한다. Topic Policy와 Subscriber의 수신 권한을 모두 확인한다. Message를 발행한 계정과 Consumer 계정이 달라도 지원 Policy로 연결할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-topics\"><h2>Standard Topics<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#standard-topics\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 지원 Endpoint에 높은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>의 전달을 제공한다. 중복 가능성과 순서 조건을 Consumer에서 처리해야 한다. HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·Email·SMS·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 등 Endpoint별 Delivery 동작과 지원 범위가 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fifo-topics\"><h2>FIFO <span class=\"full-name\">(First In, First Out)</span> Topics<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fifo-topics\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>순서·Deduplication이 필요한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 연계에 사용한다. Message Group·Deduplication 조건과 구독 Queue 유형에 따른 보장 범위를 확인한다. Standard Topic의 모든 Endpoint를 동일하게 지원한다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"subscription-filter-policies\"><h2>Subscription Filter Policies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#subscription-filter-policies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Message Attribute 또는 지원 Payload 조건으로 Subscriber가 받을 Message를 선택한다. Filter로 불필요한 Consumer 처리량을 줄일 수 있다. Filter 정책 적용 지연과 필드 구조·자료형을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fan-out-with-sqs\"><h2>Fan-out with SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#fan-out-with-sqs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Subscriber마다 Queue를 두어 각 시스템의 처리 속도·재시도를 분리한다. 한 Consumer 장애가 다른 Consumer의 Queue 진행을 막지 않는다. Queue Policy에서 SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span> Topic의 SendMessage 권한을 제한한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"delivery-retries-and-dead-letter-queues\"><h2>Delivery Retries and Dead-letter Queues<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#delivery-retries-and-dead-letter-queues\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Endpoint별 Retry 정책이 다르며 최종 전달 실패를 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>에 보관할 수 있다. SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>는 Subscriber 전달 실패, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> Consumer <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>는 처리 실패라는 위치 차이가 있다. 둘의 Alarm과 재처리 절차를 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"security-and-observability\"><h2>Security and Observability<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#security-and-observability\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Topic Encryption·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·Resource Policy와 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>를 사용한다. Delivery Status와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> 지표로 실패를 관찰한다. Email·SMS 등 외부 채널은 Content와 비용·수신 조건을 별도로 관리한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>주문 완료 Topic에 Billing Queue와 Shipping Queue를 구독시킨다. Billing Worker가 느려져도 Shipping은 자기 Queue에서 계속 처리한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>하나의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 여러 워커가 나눠 소비하는 것과 팬아웃은 다르다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sns/latest/dg/welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sns/latest/dg/welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q074\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q074\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q071\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q072\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">이전 용어 <b>Snowball Edge</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">다음 용어 <b>SQS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
